---
export const prerender = true;
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Icon from "../components/ui/Icon.astro";
---

<Layout title="TakeoutFix | Terms of Service" description="Read the Terms of Service for TakeoutFix. Understand your rights, licensing, user responsibilities, and limitations of liability.">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-16 mt-12 font-sans">
    
    <!-- Hero Header -->
    <div class="text-center mb-16 relative">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-zinc-100 dark:bg-zinc-900 border border-zinc-200 dark:border-zinc-800 text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider mb-6 font-mono">
        <Icon name="file-text" class="w-4 h-4 text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100" />
        Legal Agreements &amp; Terms
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-zinc-900 dark:text-white mb-4">Terms of Service</h1>
      <p class="text-lg md:text-xl text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400">Last updated: September 28, 2026</p>
    </div>

    <!-- 2-Column Responsive Layout -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-10">
      
      <!-- Main Content (lg:col-span-8) -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-8 space-y-12 leading-relaxed">
        
        <section id="terms-acceptance" class="space-y-4">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-zinc-900 dark:text-white">1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
          <p class="text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            By accessing and using TakeoutFix, you agree to be bound by these Terms of Service. If you do not agree to these terms, please do not use our service.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section id="terms-license" class="space-y-4">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-zinc-900 dark:text-white">2. License Grant</h2>
          <p class="text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            TakeoutFix grants you a personal, non-exclusive, non-transferable license to use the software solely for recovering metadata from your own Google Takeout exports. The software operates locally on your device.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section id="terms-age" class="space-y-4">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-zinc-900 dark:text-white">3. Age Eligibility &amp; COPPA Compliance</h2>
          <p class="text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            TakeoutFix is designed for general audiences and is not directed to children under 13. By using this software or creating an account, you represent and warrant that you are at least 13 years of age (or at least 16 years of age in the European Economic Area and United Kingdom). In accordance with the Children's Online Privacy Protection Act (COPPA), TakeoutFix does not knowingly collect, request, or retain personal data from children under 13.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section id="terms-responsibilities" class="space-y-4">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-zinc-900 dark:text-white">4. User Responsibilities</h2>
          <p class="text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            You agree to use TakeoutFix only for lawful purposes. You are responsible for ensuring you have the legal right to process the Google Takeout data you provide to the application.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section id="terms-access" class="space-y-4">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-zinc-900 dark:text-white">5. Software Access &amp; 100% Free Use</h2>
          <p class="text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            TakeoutFix is provided as a 100% free, client-side utility. All users have full, unrestricted access to the complete metadata restoration engine directly in their browser without required subscriptions, hidden paywalls, or fees. Optional donations and sponsorships may be provided via public GitHub Sponsors.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section id="terms-liability" class="space-y-4">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-zinc-900 dark:text-white">5. Limitation of Liability</h2>
          <p class="text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            TakeoutFix modifies local files at your request. We strongly recommend maintaining backups of your original Google Takeout exports and destination folders. TakeoutFix is provided "as is" without warranty of any kind. In no event shall we be liable for data loss, corruption, or indirect damages arising from the use of this software.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section id="terms-termination" class="space-y-4">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-zinc-900 dark:text-white">6. Termination</h2>
          <p class="text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            We reserve the right to suspend or terminate access to community services (such as public reviews or support tickets) if you violate these terms or engage in abusive conduct.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section id="terms-governing" class="space-y-4">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-zinc-900 dark:text-white">7. Governing Law</h2>
          <p class="text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            These terms are governed by the laws of your jurisdiction. Any disputes shall be resolved in the competent courts of that jurisdiction.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section id="terms-contact" class="space-y-4">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-zinc-900 dark:text-white">8. Contact</h2>
          <p class="text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            If you have questions about these Terms of Service, please contact us via our <a href="/contact" class="text-zinc-900 dark:text-white underline font-semibold">Contact Page</a> or directly via email at <a href="mailto:takeoutfix.support@gmail.com" class="text-zinc-900 dark:text-white underline font-semibold">takeoutfix.support@gmail.com</a>.
          </p>
        </section>

      </div>

      <!-- Sticky Quick-Navigation Sidebar (lg:col-span-4) -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-4 space-y-6">
        <div class="sticky top-28 space-y-6">
          
          <div class="bg-zinc-50 dark:bg-zinc-900/50 border border-zinc-200 dark:border-zinc-800 rounded-2xl p-6 shadow-sm">
            <h3 class="text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-zinc-900 dark:text-white mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
              <Icon name="book-open" class="w-4 h-4 text-zinc-900 dark:text-white" />
              Sections
            </h3>
            <nav class="space-y-2 text-sm text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400">
              <a href="#terms-acceptance" class="block hover:text-zinc-900 dark:hover:text-white transition-colors py-1">1. Acceptance of Terms</a>
              <a href="#terms-license" class="block hover:text-zinc-900 dark:hover:text-white transition-colors py-1">2. License Grant</a>
              <a href="#terms-age" class="block hover:text-zinc-900 dark:hover:text-white transition-colors py-1">3. Age Eligibility (COPPA)</a>
              <a href="#terms-responsibilities" class="block hover:text-zinc-900 dark:hover:text-white transition-colors py-1">4. User Responsibilities</a>
              <a href="#terms-access" class="block hover:text-zinc-900 dark:hover:text-white transition-colors py-1">5. Software Access &amp; 100% Free Use</a>
              <a href="#terms-liability" class="block hover:text-zinc-900 dark:hover:text-white transition-colors py-1">6. Limitation of Liability</a>
              <a href="#terms-termination" class="block hover:text-zinc-900 dark:hover:text-white transition-colors py-1">7. Termination</a>
              <a href="#terms-governing" class="block hover:text-zinc-900 dark:hover:text-white transition-colors py-1">8. Governing Law</a>
              <a href="#terms-contact" class="block hover:text-zinc-900 dark:hover:text-white transition-colors py-1">9. Contact Information</a>
            </nav>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-zinc-900 dark:bg-white text-white dark:text-zinc-900 rounded-2xl p-6 shadow-md">
            <h4 class="font-bold text-base mb-2">Need Help?</h4>
            <p class="text-xs leading-relaxed text-zinc-300 dark:text-zinc-600 mb-4">
              Have questions regarding our terms or licensing? Reach out to our technical desk anytime.
            </p>
            <a 
              href="/contact" 
              class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold px-4 py-2 rounded-xl bg-white/10 dark:bg-zinc-100 hover:bg-white/20 dark:hover:bg-zinc-200 transition-colors"
            >
              Contact Support &rarr;
            </a>
          </div>

        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

  </div>
</Layout>
